{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VEG09QC4Eg1794843070.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國總統特朗普離開白宮，出發前往菲律賓時表示，三方會晤將討論裁核、伊朗和烏克蘭問題，而在中國期間，可能會同朝鮮領袖金正恩會晤。</p><p></p><p>美國總統特朗普說：「我們會同國家主席習近平一起，他一個月前在這裡與我一起，我們將會晤俄羅斯總統普京，我們也可能會晤朝鮮領袖金正恩，所以我們完全有可能取得許多成果。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T16:00:10.062483+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T14:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:45:57.789353+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T15:53:31.146702+00:00","content_hash":"25db297edc2177cc4dee25dda76b903f14ef3fcbc270dd5945b34f5ff12d3469","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T16:00:10.062483+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}